[{"answer":"Hi Tony, thanks ever so much for coming.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/1.mp3"},{"answer":"You know we've been asked to organise something for John's farewell?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, sure, it's about time we started working out details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/4.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't want to leave it so late that it's double the work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm, mm, right, do you want me to take notes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/6.mp3"},{"answer":"That'd be great, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, first thing is,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/8.mp3"},{"answer":"when is the best time to hold it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, he leaves on the 24th of December.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/10.mp3"},{"answer":"So what about the 22nd?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I think that's about right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/12.mp3"},{"answer":"We want it quite near the time, don't we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, and what about a venue?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/14.mp3"},{"answer":"In college? A hotel?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I think a hotel will probably work out rather expensive,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and I've been looking at the College Dining Room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/17.mp3"},{"answer":"That seems pretty reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, yeah, why not?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/19.mp3"},{"answer":"And then we ought to be thinking about invitations...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Who mustn't we forget to invite?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, obviously John and his wife.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And the Director.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The office staff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And all the teachers and all the students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyone else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Faculty Heads?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/28.mp3"},{"answer":"No, better draw the line, I don't think it's necessary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't mind writing the invitations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/31.mp3"},{"answer":"When shall we get them out for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Enough time but not too early.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/33.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the fifteenth of December?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there are exams on the 16th - better avoid them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/35.mp3"},{"answer":"10th?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that should do it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/37.mp3"},{"answer":"So what does that leave?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, a present.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you mind doing that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/40.mp3"},{"answer":"No, not at all;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/41.mp3"},{"answer":"we usually go round with an envelope during coffee break, don't we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, coffee break's always the best time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/43.mp3"},{"answer":"'cos people have got their money handy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Do we suggest an amount?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Or does it seem a bit unfair?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/47.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I think people welcome it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/48.mp3"},{"answer":"We suggested 6 dollars last time, is that okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, plenty, I would have thought,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/50.mp3"},{"answer":"which should leave us with about 90 dollars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you any ideas for presents?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've been having a little think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/54.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, he loves music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/56.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I thought I'd check on prices for, well, perhaps CD players.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's a, that's a good idea,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/58.mp3"},{"answer":"and also I thought maybe, you know, a set of dictionaries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I heard him say he needed a good one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/60.mp3"},{"answer":"The other thing he was saying last week was that his computer printer had broken.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Umm. No, I'd be really frightened about getting the wrong type.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/63.mp3"},{"answer":"The other thing is something for the home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Jill suggested a coffee maker.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll certainly find out what they cost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, have you got all that down?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Now we need to think a little more about the money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I know we've got a set amount from the Social Fund.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, what does that cover?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/71.mp3"},{"answer":"It's meant to cover the cost of the room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And a certain amount for food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/73.mp3"},{"answer":"And also drinks?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yeah, certainly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/75.mp3"},{"answer":"But will it be enough?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/76.mp3"},{"answer":"What we've done in the past is to ask guests to bring some snacks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/78.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't ask them to bring more drinks because we figure that's...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/79.mp3"},{"answer":"that should come from the Social Fund.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else for the guests to bring?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, oh, some music,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/83.mp3"},{"answer":"because there'll be a tape deck there in the room, and we can have some dancing later on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/85.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just a thought, but a couple of years ago we had a really good party where we set up...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/86.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, some simple games.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Wasn't it based on photos from the students and teachers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/89.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/90.mp3"},{"answer":"So we should ask the guests to bring photos.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/91.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. I'll put it on the invitations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/92.mp3"},{"answer":"Now the last thing is,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/93.mp3"},{"answer":"who shall we ask to do the speech?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/94.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't you think it might be nice to have one of the students?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/95.mp3"},{"answer":"Well then, the Student Leader?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/96.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, much better than the Director giving speeches again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/97.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay then, I'll ask her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/98.mp3"},{"answer":"Lovely!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/99.mp3"},{"answer":"So, is that all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/100.mp3"},{"answer":"Looks like it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/101.mp3"},{"answer":"Great! Thanks ever so much...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-1-2023-08-13-18-09-52/102.mp3"}]
